{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your job is simple: 1. Collect all Amalgams 2. Don't die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Luckily for you Amalgams, mutated creatures of unknown origin, already come captured in their own little boxes known as F-POT's (Floating Pots).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You only have to worry about collecting them, use your crane and get it all inside the ship's hold. Don't worry if this sounds a little abstract, everything is explained in your instructions manual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Navegate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've got a whole fishing ship for yourself! Be careful not to crash it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/driving_gif.gif?t=1747436440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">F-POT's are floating jails that float to the surface once activated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/buoy.gif?t=1747436440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Capture!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You shouldn't really find any surprises, Amalgams are usually found in catatonic state or plain dead due to the Amalgamation process that origines them, so relax, you'll be fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072380/extras/turtle.gif?t=1747436440\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072380?t=1747436440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3072380?t=1747436440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st